      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MIGHTY MELBOURNE (1) finished out of the frame on debut, then improved nicely and scored maiden success (22.73) at Geelong over 400m. Shows good promise and worth following up. PAW KABUTO (4) caught the eye with a fast early split last time and setting up a 4 length win at this track over 450m in 25.68, making it two wins on end. Leading chance again. WHERE'S MICK (7) scored (22.18) last time out at this track in a Bottom Up - Maiden and will break from box 7 for the first time. Ran the fastest time on the program in his latest win. Has hit winning form and can go on with it. MOLLY ROCHELLE (3) can improve on an unplaced run here last time out.",
